emp_1458_1707185854658_897\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1458\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1458\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1458&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/keep-calm-and-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/keep-calm-and-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> Keep Calm and&hellip; [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/keep-calm-and-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://theonyxpath.com/keep-calm-and-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-05T18:18:34-08:00","id":1530065,"title":"","content":"could this be it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-05T20:29:34-08:00","id":1530073,"title":"","content":"<b>You\u2019re an Iscariot!</b><br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;You're a revolutionary firebrand, willing to sacrifice even those you love for the good of all. You're violent, but to oppose those who oppress others. Some wonder how you sleep at night. Well...you don't have to.&quot;<br /> <br /> And now I'm confused on a higher level and about more important things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-06T04:37:38-08:00","id":1530088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AberrantEyes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1512116-curseborne?p=1530073#post1530073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>You\u2019re an Iscariot!</b><br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;You're a revolutionary firebrand, willing to sacrifice even those you love for the good of all. You're violent, but to oppose those who oppress others. Some wonder how you sleep at night. Well...you don't have to.&quot;<br /> <br /> And now I'm confused on a higher level and about more important things.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's more tantalizing lore hints in Nephilim and Battlefield Angel.<br /> <br /> The Angels fight the Outside and are troubled by their own fanaticism...the Nephilim actively explore it for the sake of their families and personal intrigue against their particular family's rivals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-06T14:09:02-08:00","id":1530109,"title":"","content":"I took the quiz a few times and I think I've found a pattern. I think the quiz reveals that Curseborne characters will have 3 defining elements:<br /> <br /> 1) What sort of creature are you (Chimera was my first quiz result)<br /> <br /> 2) What your purpose/outlook/philosophy (Iscariot as AberrentEye's result was)<br /> <br /> 3) What organization do you belong to (my second quiz result was You're part of the Network!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-06T16:28:01-08:00","id":1530120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1512116-curseborne?p=1530109#post1530109\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I took the quiz a few times and I think I've found a pattern. I think the quiz reveals that Curseborne characters will have 3 defining elements:<br /> <br /> 1) What sort of creature are you (Chimera was my first quiz result)<br /> <br /> 2) What your purpose/outlook/philosophy (Iscariot as AberrentEye's result was)<br /> <br /> 3) What organization do you belong to (my second quiz result was You're part of the Network!)</div> </div> </div> </div>So you might say you found three types of paths then?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-06T17:19:17-08:00","id":1530122,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZakRulz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1512116-curseborne?p=1530120#post1530120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So you might say you found three types of paths then?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, that's a great way to say it. and it's very on brand with the Storypath system","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-06T21:05:35-08:00","id":1530130,"title":"","content":"It seems that I'm a Sphinx =)<br /> <br /> You are a lover of fine treasures and you hoard them to yourself greedily. You adore cracking open a mystery to reveal the fruits of secrecy buried within. You\u2019d rather see an army in your employ fall before having to get your own claws dirty. You see the past as something far back in the rear view.<br /> <br /> I liked it =)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you like Alchemicals, please check out my DeviantArt Gallery!! <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> - 5 Magic Materials BeamKlaves and Gyroscopic Chakrans ? OK<br /> - Autochthonia updated World Map? OK<br /> And many more! <a href=\"http://efq.deviantart.com/gallery/48131405/Alchemicals\" target=\"_blank\">http://efq.deviantart.com/gallery/48131405/Alchemicals</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2498-yukiartic","name":"Yukiartic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-11T20:09:35-08:00","id":1530607,"title":"","content":"I just took it again, giving different but still applicable answers, and it swerved in a direction that resulted in Chimera. (&quot;I did nothing wrong.&quot;) Maybe the third go-round will give an allegiance path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-12T10:53:14-08:00","id":1530652,"title":"","content":"Took the quiz several times and I think I've spotted a few Allegiance Paths:<br /> The Network, The Eight Hands, Keepers of the Broken Vine<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria\">&quot;You\u2019re part of the Network!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria\">You\u2019re well connected to a variety of people, and you use those connections to solve all your problems. Others think you\u2019re being used by your family, and maybe you are, but they offer so much value that it's hard to disconnect.&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria\">&quot;You\u2019re one of the Eight Hands!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria\">You enjoy dark places and possess a morbid sense of humor. You enjoy traps, and playing with your prey. Some people think you get off on being creepy and weird. They\u2019re probably right. You\u2019re always up for a beer with mates, but mates are hard to come by\u2026&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria\">&quot;You\u2019re a Keeper of the Broken Vine!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Cambria\">You\u2019re a plant wizard, green witch, or horticultural manipulator. You seek to build a community and reconnect humanity with nature, even if you struggle with the balance of hiding from consumer culture and teaching a better way to live.&quot;</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-12T22:48:28-08:00","id":1530715,"title":"","content":"<b>Monday Meeting Notes</b> this week seems to imply that, at least part of, Curseborn are connected to computer glitches. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<br /> <br /> <i>'Finally, it was nice to actually get through a conversation with Matthew today without either of our computers going hinky on us. I\u2019ve also noted that the anonymous incursions into our media have seemed to ease down. Don\u2019t know if it\u2019s a good sign or a bad one though. Maybe the intruders have gone elsewhere, or are busy\u2026but maybe they are just lying in wait and gathering their strength and resources for an all-out blitz!</i><br /> <br /> <i>A couple of our Monday Meeting gang have mentioned either falling asleep in front of, or waking up in front of, their computers. Not sure if that phenomenon is connected, but it\u2019s not how things are usually done, so it\u2019s suspect at this point.</i><br /> <br /> <i>EDIT: And after I wrote this, I heard from Mirthful Mike that his power is out until tomorrow, so he can\u2019t send the art pieces we usually display each week!</i><br /> <br /> <i>Meanwhile, as we try and get things sorted, please worry not, and don\u2019t fear our:</i><br /> <br /> <i>Moth Worlds, Moth Path!'</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/february-comes-in-on-little-cat-feet-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">https://theonyxpath.com/february-com...meeting-notes/</a>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-27T01:32:41-08:00","id":1531606,"title":"","content":"<b>Awkward GM Corbin</b> is cracking everything we know about <b>Curseborne</b>! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzIw1R38RKY\" data-code=\"QzIw1R38RKY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/QzIw1R38RKY/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-01T09:39:44-08:00","id":1531787,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/6NnzYWke4smz470EwBmYc3?si=aayjMH1nQHKpPXiuupIkgg\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Pathcast gang plays <b>Curseborn </b>in this Ep - Whatever <b>Curseborn</b> is... </a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-01-2024, 01:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-01T10:24:03-08:00","id":1531789,"title":"","content":"Any word on when they\u2019re gonna quit playing coy about it and just announce something? It\u2019s honestly tiresome at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-03T12:34:35-08:00","id":1531914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1512116-curseborne?p=1531789#post1531789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> It\u2019s honestly tiresome at this point.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the general sentiment of everyone in my gaming circles and I've seen it crop up in Discord and RPG net as well. At this point, you'd think they might start paying attention to the feedback.<br /> <br /> I was excited up until maybe the third mystery tease. Fish or cut bait.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-04T19:16:02-08:00","id":1531989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1512116-curseborne?p=1531914#post1531914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is the general sentiment of everyone in my gaming circles and I've seen it crop up in Discord and RPG net as well. At this point, you'd think they might start paying attention to the feedback.<br /> <br /> I was excited up until maybe the third mystery tease. Fish or cut bait.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your circles are not mine. We're having a great time seeing the document previews and collating them on the Discord. <br /> <br /> And, well....<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/SXWf1oIY-KI?si=PiWYGxhHhAlzcaek&amp;t=507\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_p